        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.4721069335938,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "The strength levels of the recommendations (including those from the other documents",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18463134765625,
        461.6299133300781,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "approved by the WHO Guidelines Review Committee) are defined as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        121.41415405273438,
        513.4720458984375,
        134.83465576171875
      ],
      "text": "Strong The Panel is confident that the desirable effects of adherence to the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157.0408935546875,
        135.28314208984375,
        404.5439453125,
        148.6346435546875
      ],
      "text": "recommendation outweigh the undesirable effects",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        155.01712036132812,
        513.3798828125,
        168.4376220703125
      ],
      "text": "Conditional The Panel concludes that the desirable effects of adherence to the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        155.9368896484375,
        168.8861083984375,
        502.2824401855469,
        182.23760986328125
      ],
      "text": "recommendation probably outweigh the undesirable effects. However:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157.03939819335938,
        188.692138671875,
        424.8883972167969,
        202.1586456298828
      ],
      "text": "data to support the recommendation are scarce; or -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157.03939819335938,
        202.49212646484375,
        513.404052734375,
        215.95863342285156
      ],
      "text": "the recommendation is applicable only to a specific group, population  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        175.03939819335938,
        216.2921142578125,
        238.30088806152344,
        229.64361572265625
      ],
      "text": "or setting; or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157.03939819335938,
        230.09210205078125,
        503.9049987792969,
        243.55860900878906
      ],
      "text": "new evidence may result in a change to the risk-benefit balance; or -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157.03939819335938,
        243.89208984375,
        513.484130859375,
        257.35858154296875
      ],
      "text": "the benefits may not warrant the cost or resource requirements in all  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        174.889404296875,
        258.29010009765625,
        215.78338623046875,
        271.6416015625
      ],
      "text": "settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        288.8512268066406,
        93.59339904785156,
        305.70721435546875
      ],
      "text": "S",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.80329895019531,
        292.8580017089844,
        444.14520263671875,
        304.6572265625
      ],
      "text": "ummary of evidence and considerations underlying each",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        311.2580261230469,
        186.1949920654297,
        323.0572509765625
      ],
      "text": "recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        333.46051025390625,
        307.07537841796875,
        350.1885070800781
      ],
      "text": "Diagnosis of TB in children (Chapter 3)",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        355.1205139160156,
        186.58139038085938,
        371.97650146484375
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        379.7239990234375,
        236.05740356445312,
        393.35150146484375
      ],
      "text": "Source of recommendations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        398.76800537109375,
        513.4375610351562,
        412.1885070800781
      ],
      "text": "Automated real-time nucleic acid amplification technology for rapid and simultaneous",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        414.7644958496094,
        513.3799438476562,
        428.18499755859375
      ],
      "text": "detection of tuberculosis and rifampicin resistance: Xpert MTB/RIF system for the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        430.760986328125,
        510.1828918457031,
        444.1814880371094
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis of pulmonary and extrapulmonary TB in adults and children. Policy Update.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        446.82647705078125,
        295.06390380859375,
        460.177978515625
      ],
      "text": "Geneva, World Health Organization, 2013.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        471.0625,
        242.04891967773438,
        484.69000244140625
      ],
      "text": "Summary of recent evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        490.1755065917969,
        513.41455078125,
        503.5270080566406
      ],
      "text": "The Panel has evaluated WHO 2011 recommendations and more recent evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        506.1719970703125,
        513.4490356445312,
        519.5234985351562
      ],
      "text": "(published up to July 2012). The Panel recognized that data on diagnostic performance",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        522.1685180664062,
        513.4375,
        535.52001953125
      ],
      "text": "of Xpert MTB/RIF in children are emerging (and will continue to emerge). Recently",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        538.1649780273438,
        513.4720458984375,
        551.5164794921875
      ],
      "text": "published data were considered and are encouraging; they included four studies",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        554.1614379882812,
        510.20599365234375,
        567.512939453125
      ],
      "text": "comparing Xpert with liquid culture on respiratory samples. All studies were from high-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        570.157958984375,
        513.391357421875,
        583.5094604492188
      ],
      "text": "burden TB settings and two were from the same study population. There were almost",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        586.1544799804688,
        513.4835815429688,
        599.5059814453125
      ],
      "text": "no published data on the use of non-respiratory samples from children (although Panel",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        602.1509399414062,
        513.4374389648438,
        615.50244140625
      ],
      "text": "was aware that studies were ongoing). Thus far, the data for children indicated that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        618.1474609375,
        513.4834594726562,
        631.4989624023438
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF has much higher sensitivity than sputum microscopy. Use of two samples",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        634.1439819335938,
        513.4374389648438,
        647.4954833984375
      ],
      "text": "increases sensitivity, although it also increases the cost of the test. Sensitivity and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        650.071533203125,
        513.4261474609375,
        663.4920043945312
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis specificity compared with M.   culture and the rapid results (especially crucial",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        666.1370239257812,
        510.26361083984375,
        679.488525390625
      ],
      "text": "in MDR-TB or HIV-associated TB) are similar to those reported from the studies in adults.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        690.401123046875,
        161.72140502929688,
        704.0286254882812
      ],
      "text": "Panel decision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        709.5140991210938,
        513.4949340820312,
        722.8656005859375
      ],
      "text": "At the time of its meeting (July 2012), the Panel was aware that WHO commissioned",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        725.5106201171875,
        513.4606323242188,
        738.8621215820312
      ],
      "text": "three systematic reviews to update and revise the 2011 Policy guidance on the utility of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        741.507080078125,
        513.4720458984375,
        754.8585815429688
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/Rif for the diagnosis of tuberculosis and Rifampicin resistance in pulmonary,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        757.5036010742188,
        513.4488525390625,
        770.8551025390625
      ],
      "text": "extrapulmonary and childhood TB. Therefore, the Panel recommended that WHO use",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        773.5001220703125,
        513.4029541015625,
        786.8516235351562
      ],
      "text": "the newest recommendations as approved by the WHO Guideline Review Committee",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        789.49658203125,
        129.15338134765625,
        802.8480834960938
      ],
      "text": "in 2013.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "92",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}